<title>UK: GECC sets 100 million stg Dec 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 100 million stg Dec 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.7775  PAY DATE  L-19.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.59     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
